OL,3,GNEWSABubble-blowing Tesla helps owner
OL,4,Abreak into car scene
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a bright pink,
OL,7,Fbubble-blowing Tesla said her audacious
OL,8,Fcar helped to break into a
OL,9,Fmale-dominated culture.
OL,11,FJo King, 45, designed the eye-catching
OL,12,F#45,000 electric vehicle with her
OL,13,Fhusband, Matt, who she lives with in
OL,14,FWest Mersea, Essex.
OL,16,FTogether, they have kitted it out with
OL,17,Fheart-shaped exhausts and a number
OL,18,Fplate that almost spells out "unicorn"
OL,19,F- and King admits it gets plenty of
OL,20,F"double takes".
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
